OL,3,GNEWSAPolice 'secretive' before man's
OL,4,Adeath - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man who died days after
OL,7,Fbeing arrested said they felt police
OL,8,Fwere "secretive" when they asked for
OL,9,Finformation on his whereabouts.
OL,11,FNoel Porter, from Woodbridge, in
OL,12,FSuffolk, was arrested on November 19
OL,13,Fafter being pulled over and
OL,14,Fbreathalysed on the A134 between
OL,15,FSudbury and Bury St Edmunds.
OL,17,FThe 25-year-old was held in custody
OL,18,Fbefore appearing at Ipswich
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court on 21 November,
OL,20,Fwhere he admitted to drink-driving. The
OL,21,Fnext evening he was found dead.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
