OL,3,GNEWSAPolice 'secretive' before man's
OL,4,Adeath - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement read to 10 jurors on the
OL,7,Ffirst day of an inquest at Suffolk
OL,8,FCoroner's Court, his mum Pamela Porter,
OL,9,Fsaid his family were concerned for his
OL,10,Fmental health but felt police were
OL,11,Freluctant to give her any details.
